  "body": "## Summary\n\nSupports #54.\n\nAdd a self-contained visual prototype for the proposed Usage Explorer roadmap.\n\nThe artifact preserves the dashboard's compact dark visual system while demonstrating:\n\n- one canonical range/tool/model/project/search scope;\n- visible removable filter state;\n- decision-guided period summary and pricing coverage;\n- chart-to-filter drilldown;\n- scoped model and session tables;\n- server-pagination direction;\n- metadata-first session detail;\n- explicit conceptual versus expected behavior boundaries.\n\n## Visual prototype\n\n- [Open the self-contained HTML prototype](https://github.com/raychrisgdp/coding-agent-usage-dashboard/blob/edd02b199a9b1c7c2b64e7233bb52b6b872af64c/docs/prototypes/usage-explorer.html)\n- [Desktop capture](https://github.com/raychrisgdp/coding-agent-usage-dashboard/blob/edd02b199a9b1c7c2b64e7233bb52b6b872af64c/docs/prototypes/usage-explorer-desktop.png)\n- [Mobile capture](https://github.com/raychrisgdp/coding-agent-usage-dashboard/blob/edd02b199a9b1c7c2b64e7233bb52b6b872af64c/docs/prototypes/usage-explorer-mobile.png)\n\n![Usage Explorer desktop prototype](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raychrisgdp/coding-agent-usage-dashboard/edd02b199a9b1c7c2b64e7233bb52b6b872af64c/docs/prototypes/usage-explorer-desktop.png)\n\n## Prototype status\n\nConceptual:\n\n- exact visual spacing;\n- sample values;\n- final API and endpoint shapes;\n- production chart implementation.\n\nExpected behavior for later implementation issues:\n\n- one canonical filter scope across overview, chart, model breakdown, and history;\n- URL-persisted filter state;\n- chart-to-row drilldown;\n- paginated usage history;\n- privacy-safe, metadata-first session detail;\n- unavailable source fields remain unavailable rather than zero.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `REVIEW_MODE=docs scripts/review.sh`\n- `git diff --check`\n- extracted inline JavaScript passes `node --check`\n- Playwright desktop smoke at 1440x1000\n- Playwright mobile smoke at 390x844\n- no document-level horizontal overflow at either width\n- no browser console or page errors\n- quick range, filter apply/remove, chart table fallback, chart drilldown, session drawer, Escape close, and focus return exercised\n\nThis PR adds a design artifact only. It does not change dashboard production behavior.\n",
